Hi Harry,

I have been a Linux kernel developer for several years, and I like it so 
much。

I spent much time on reading source codes, and I found many documents 
haven't been translated into Chinese,

so I make a plan to translate all documents into Chinese to make others 
easily know the architecture of

the Linux modules.

So, can you give me some advices to make it work well?

